Is it possible to configure the bridge to behave more transparently? That is
to say there are certain frames which don't usually get forwarded by a
bridge that conforms to spec. Is it possible to configure the bridge to
break the spec blindly forward these frames? I'd like a bridge that behaves
more like a hub or like what ettercap calls a bridge while still taking
advantage of the filtering / firewall capability.

